    "**ADAM ID: **[sm\\_us6000synm](https://api.adam.geospatial.wfp.org/api/collections/adam.adam_eq_events/items?uid=sm_us6000synm) Magnitude 5.8 earthquake at 37.376 depth occurred on May 19 2026 45km SW of Pango. The epicentre of the earthquake was located at latitude -18.1598 longitude 168.1719. It impacted 31160 people within 50km. WFP’s Automated Disaster Analysis and Mapping (ADAM) system is an operational system for collecting, analysing and mapping geospatial and socio-economic information following sudden onset humanitarian emergencies."
